('whole-turmeric', 'whole-turmeric', 'Whole Turmeric', 'Whole Spices', '', 'Salem & Nizamabad polished whole turmeric fingers and bulbs with high natural curcumin.', '/assets/products/turmeric.jpg', 'Salem & Erode (Tamil Nadu), Nizamabad (Telangana)', 6, '{"id":"whole-turmeric","slug":"whole-turmeric","name":"Whole Turmeric","botanicalName":"Curcuma longa","scientific":"Curcuma longa","category":"Whole Spices","categoryKey":"whole-spices","tagline":"Salem & Nizamabad polished whole turmeric fingers and bulbs with high natural curcumin.","isFlagship":false,"partUsed":"Boiled, sun-dried & polished whole rhizomes","shortDescription":"Premium double-polished Salem and Nizamabad whole turmeric fingers with high curcumin (3%–5%+) and certified low moisture.","fullDescription":"Origintra Exim exports export-grade whole turmeric fingers and bulbs directly sourced from India''s premier growing regions in Salem and Erode (Tamil Nadu), Nizamabad (Telangana), and Sangli (Maharashtra). Our whole turmeric is thoroughly cleaned, boiled, sun-cured, and mechanically polished to achieve a vibrant golden-yellow appearance and concentrated curcumin levels (3.0% to 5.5%+). Each lot undergoes rigorous laboratory testing for moisture, volatile oil, total ash, and zero synthetic adulteration (guaranteed 100% free of lead chromate and Sudan dyes).","origin":"Salem & Erode (Tamil Nadu), Nizamabad (Telangana)","grade":"Salem Double Polished Finger · Nizamabad Finger · Erode Bulb · Rajapuri","availableForms":["Whole Polished Fingers","Whole Bulbs (Gatta)"],"packagingOptions":["25kg / 50kg Multi-Wall Kraft Paper Sacks with PE Inner Liner","High-Density Polypropylene (PP) Woven Export Sacks","50kg Jute Export Bags with Moisture Barrier Liner"],"applications":["Industrial Spice Grinding & Extraction","Nutraceutical Curcumin Processing","Ayurvedic & Herbal Preparations","Wholesale Repacking & Culinary Retail"],"loadability":"Approx. 18 MT per 20ft FCL / 26 MT per 40ft FCL","image":"/assets/product