('rasam-powder', 'rasam-powder', 'Rasam Powder', 'Blends & Seasonings', '', 'Pepper and cumin dominant South Indian digestive broth spice blend with aromatic roasted notes.', '/assets/products/rasam-powder.jpg', 'Blended in India', 22, '{"id":"rasam-powder","slug":"rasam-powder","name":"Rasam Powder","botanicalName":"Spice blend","scientific":"Spice blend","category":"Blends & Seasonings","categoryKey":"blends","tagline":"Pepper and cumin dominant South Indian digestive broth spice blend with aromatic roasted notes.","isFlagship":false,"partUsed":"Ground multi-spice blend","shortDescription":"Pepper and cumin dominant South Indian digestive broth spice blend with aromatic roasted notes.","fullDescription":"Rasam powder is dominated by black pepper, cumin and coriander, balanced with toor dal, mustard, dry red chilli and curry leaf. Origin Exim mills at controlled temperature to retain pepper volatiles.","origin":"Blended in India","grade":"Standard · Custom · Pepper-forward","availableForms":["Whole Ground multi-spice blend","Ground Powder"],"packagingOptions":["25kg / 50kg Multi-Wall Kraft Paper Sacks with PE Inner Liner","High-Density Polypropylene (PP) Woven Export Sacks","Custom Private Label Foodservice Pouches Available"],"applications":["South Indian restaurant supply","Soup and broth manufacturing","Retail private label"],"loadability":"Approx. 12-14 MT per 20ft FCL / 24-26 MT per 40ft FCL","image":"/assets/products/rasam-powder.jpg","specifications":[{"label":"Origin","value":"Blended in India"},{"label":"Botanical Name","value":"Spice blend"},{"label":"Part Used","value":"Ground multi-spice blend"},{"label":"Grade / Varieties","value":"Standard · Custom · Pepper-forward"}],"qualityProcess":["Multi-stage magnetic separation and pneumatic air-sifting to remove field extraneous matter","Optical color Sortex sorting for uniform seed/pod size, color, and density grading","Certified laboratory testing for pesticide MRLs, microbial limits, and heavy metals","Batc