('biryani-masala', 'biryani-masala', 'Biryani Masala', 'Blends & Seasonings', '', 'Royal whole-spice blend dominated by green cardamom, mace, nutmeg, and cloves for culinary use.', '/assets/products/biryani-masala.jpg', 'Blended in India', 23, '{"id":"biryani-masala","slug":"biryani-masala","name":"Biryani Masala","botanicalName":"Spice blend","scientific":"Spice blend","category":"Blends & Seasonings","categoryKey":"blends","tagline":"Royal whole-spice blend dominated by green cardamom, mace, nutmeg, and cloves for culinary use.","isFlagship":false,"partUsed":"Ground multi-spice blend","shortDescription":"Royal whole-spice blend dominated by green cardamom, mace, nutmeg, and cloves for culinary use.","fullDescription":"Biryani masala is built around saffron-aromatic whole spices — green cardamom, black cardamom, mace, nutmeg, star anise, clove, cinnamon and bay leaf — milled and blended to regional recipe. Origin Exim offers Hyderabadi (chilli-forward), Lucknowi (sweet-aromatic) and Kolkata (with kewra) profiles.","origin":"Blended in India","grade":"Hyderabadi · Lucknowi · Kolkata · Custom","availableForms":["Whole Ground multi-spice blend","Ground Powder"],"packagingOptions":["25kg / 50kg Multi-Wall Kraft Paper Sacks with PE Inner Liner","High-Density Polypropylene (PP) Woven Export Sacks","Custom Private Label Foodservice Pouches Available"],"applications":["Restaurant and QSR supply","Frozen biryani manufacturing","Retail private label"],"loadability":"Approx. 12-14 MT per 20ft FCL / 24-26 MT per 40ft FCL","image":"/assets/products/biryani-masala.jpg","specifications":[{"label":"Origin","value":"Blended in India"},{"label":"Botanical Name","value":"Spice blend"},{"label":"Part Used","value":"Ground multi-spice blend"},{"label":"Grade / Varieties","value":"Hyderabadi · Lucknowi · Kolkata · Custom"}],"qualityProcess":["Multi-stage magnetic separation and pneumatic air-sifting to remove field extraneous matter","Optical color Sortex sorting for uniform seed/pod si