('chaat-masala', 'chaat-masala', 'Chaat Masala', 'Blends & Seasonings', '', 'Specialty tangy seasoning blend with high-grade kala namak, amchoor, and toasted cumin.', '/assets/products/chaat-masala.jpg', 'Blended in India', 26, '{"id":"chaat-masala","slug":"chaat-masala","name":"Chaat Masala","botanicalName":"Spice blend","scientific":"Spice blend","category":"Blends & Seasonings","categoryKey":"blends","tagline":"Specialty tangy seasoning blend with high-grade kala namak, amchoor, and toasted cumin.","isFlagship":false,"partUsed":"Ground multi-spice & salt blend","shortDescription":"Specialty tangy seasoning blend with high-grade kala namak, amchoor, and toasted cumin.","fullDescription":"Chaat masala combines black salt (kala namak), amchoor (dry mango), cumin, black pepper, chilli, ginger, coriander and asafoetida. Origin Exim offers standard and low-sodium formulations, with documented iron and sulphur values from kala namak.","origin":"Blended in India","grade":"Standard · Low-sodium · Custom","availableForms":["Whole Ground multi-spice & salt blend","Ground Powder"],"packagingOptions":["25kg / 50kg Multi-Wall Kraft Paper Sacks with PE Inner Liner","High-Density Polypropylene (PP) Woven Export Sacks","Custom Private Label Foodservice Pouches Available"],"applications":["Snack seasoning industry","Restaurant table service","Retail private label"],"loadability":"Approx. 12-14 MT per 20ft FCL / 24-26 MT per 40ft FCL","image":"/assets/products/chaat-masala.jpg","specifications":[{"label":"Origin","value":"Blended in India"},{"label":"Botanical Name","value":"Spice blend"},{"label":"Part Used","value":"Ground multi-spice & salt blend"},{"label":"Grade / Varieties","value":"Standard · Low-sodium · Custom"}],"qualityProcess":["Multi-stage magnetic separation and pneumatic air-sifting to remove field extraneous matter","Optical color Sortex sorting for uniform seed/pod size, color, and density grading","Certified laboratory testing for pesticide MRLs, microbial limits,